patch=1,EE,204494F4,extended,03E00008

[Cheats\2 OPTIONAL - GTA III-style on-foot controls]
description=Requires group 1. On foot: R1 centers the camera, R2 fires, L2 aims, D-pad Left selects the previous weapon, and both D-pad Right and L1 select the next weapon. Circle remains native/fire, while D-pad Up/Down and R3 stay native. The pause menu always uses stock controls.
author=Zeroable

// GTA III-style on-foot controls for Vice City Stories.
// R1 -> native L1 / center camera.
// R2 -> native Circle / fire.
// L2 -> native R1 / aim.
// D-pad Left -> native L2 / previous weapon.
// D-pad Right and L1 -> native R2 / next weapon.
// Circle, D-pad Up/Down and R3 remain native.
